abstract: >-
  An offline decision-support simulation comparing PPO, Fixed Rotation and constrained
  current-hour optimization on matched synthetic shortage scenarios for seven Khartoum State
  localities. Includes learned demand forecasting, critical-service constraints, outage-duration
  metrics, five-run PPO training diagnostics, frozen evidence and an offline desktop interface.
